---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="About Bflopp"
	pubDate={new Date('May 01 2026')}
	heroImage="/mountain picture.jpeg"
>
	<p>

    Bflopp is a freight cost intelligence platform focused on helping shippers better understand,

    benchmark, and reduce their full truckload shipping expenses. The logistics industry is complex,

    and pricing inefficiencies often go unnoticed without proper analysis and market context.

  </p>

  <p>

    Our goal is to provide clarity in freight decision-making. We analyze shipping profiles, identify

    common cost drivers, and help businesses understand where potential inefficiencies may exist.

    When appropriate, we also connect shippers with vetted logistics providers who can help execute

    transportation strategies more effectively.

  </p>

</Layout>
